    "# Notebook 2: Structured Events Processing for HiBEHRT\n",
    "## MIMIC-IV 30-Day Readmission Prediction - Colab Arm\n",
    "\n",
    "**Objective**: Extract and process timestamped clinical events for HiBEHRT hierarchical Transformer following meeting notes 10/27/2025.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Architecture Alignment**: This notebook implements Step 3 from the meeting notes:\n",
    "- **Structured Events**: HiBEHRT tokenization (labs, vitals, procedures, diagnoses, meds)\n",
    "- **Hierarchy**: patient → admission → event sequences\n",
    "- **Temporal encoding**: relative time since admission start\n",
    "- **Value processing**: Discretize + normalized z-score embeddings\n",
    "\n",
    "**Integration with src/**: Uses existing `src/data/` modules for event processing"
   ]
  },
